# Netlify Redirects Configuration
# 301 redirects to consolidate duplicate content and improve SEO

# Redirect /en/* to /* (English is default, no need for /en prefix)
/en/*  /:splat  301

# Redirect www to non-www (if needed)
https://www.gcoman.com/*  https://gcoman.com/:splat  301!

# Redirect old URLs (if you had any legacy URLs)
# /old-page  /new-page  301

# Force HTTPS
http://gcoman.com/*  https://gcoman.com/:splat  301!
http://www.gcoman.com/*  https://gcoman.com/:splat  301!

# SPA fallback (must be last)
/*  /index.html  200
